  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### SA100 Assessee Details\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 30 Jun, 2026 at  5:38 PM\n\n### Overview\n\nThe Assessee Details section contains the taxpayer's personal and HMRC information used when preparing an SA100 Tax Return. It is important to ensure these details are accurate before submitting the return, as certain fields are mandatory and some cannot be amended after submission to HMRC.\n\n### Navigation\n\nPersonal Tax > Select Client > SA100 Return > Assessee Details\n\n### \n\n### Step 1: Add Assessee Details\n\nThe Assessee Details section displays the following information:\n\n - Owner Name (Sole Traders only)\n\n - Tax Reference Number (UTR)\n\n - Registered In (England and Wales or Scotland) (Mandatory)\n\n - Address\n\n - Postcode\n\n - Date of Birth (Mandatory)\n\n - Phone Number\n\n - National Insurance Number (Mandatory)\n\n - HMRC Office Details\n\n - Assign as Director\n\nNote: The Tax Reference Number (UTR) is mandatory and cannot be changed after the return has been submitted to HMRC.\n\n### Step 2: Save Your Changes\n\nAfter updating the information, save your changes to apply them to the SA100 return.\n\n### Additional Help\n\n### Need Help?\n\nIf you need assistance or guidance, please contact your onboarding manager or email Support@capium.com, or call us on 020 3322 5578.\n\n### Related Articles\n\n - Create a New SA100\n\n - View SA100 HMRC Form\n\n - Self Assessment Supplementary Pages\n\n### \n\n### \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188542\">Self Assessment Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">SA100 Assessee Details\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 30 Jun, 2026 at  5:38 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<h2><strong><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Overview</span></strong></h2><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">The <strong>Assessee Details</strong> section contains the taxpayer's personal and HMRC information used when preparing an SA100 Tax Return. It is important to ensure these details are accurate before submitting the return, as certain fields are mandatory and some cannot be amended after submission to HMRC.</span></p><hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Navigation</strong></span></h2><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Personal Tax &gt; Select Client &gt; SA100 Return &gt; Assessee Details</strong></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><em dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250775729/original/wn2lWxc3oMb8cxBtIsvCU1dsN-Qx2lU3yA.png?1782836897\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250775729\"></em></span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></h2><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Step 1: Add Assessee Details</strong></span></h3><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">The <strong>Assessee Details</strong> section displays the following information:</span></p><ul style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><li><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Owner Name (Sole Traders only)</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Tax Reference Number (UTR)</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Registered In (<strong>England and Wales</strong> or <strong>Scotland</strong>) <em>(Mandatory)</em></span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Address</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Postcode</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Date of Birth <em>(Mandatory)</em></span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Phone Number</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">National Insurance Number <em>(Mandatory)</em></span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">HMRC Office Details</span></p></li><li><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Assign as Director<strong dir=\"ltr\"><br></strong><strong dir=\"ltr\"><br></strong><strong dir=\"ltr\"><em>Note:</em></strong><em>&nbsp;The <strong>Tax Reference Number (UTR)</strong> is mandatory and cannot be changed after the return has been submitted to HMRC.</em></span></p></li></ul><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><em dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9250776050/original/it64YDUmHQc2OYaZzWW9wKtotRmBWTrEDQ.png?1782837214\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9250776050\"></em></span></p><hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><h3 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Step 2: Save Your Changes</strong></span></h3><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">After updating the information, save your changes to apply them to the SA100 return.</span></p><hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Additional Help</strong></span></h2><h3 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Need Help?</span></h3><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">If you need assistance or guidance, please contact your onboarding manager or email <strong><a href=\"mailto:Support@capium.com\">Support@capium.com</a></strong>, or call us on <strong>020 3322 5578</strong>.</span></p><hr style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Related Articles</span></h2><ul style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><li><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000165518?portalId=9000044273\">Create a New SA100</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000165520?portalId=9000044273\">View SA100 HMRC Form</a></p></li><li><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://capium.freshdesk.com/a/solutions/articles/9000165522?portalId=9000044273\">Self Assessment Supplementary Pages</a></p></li></ul><h4><br></h4><h4><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span><p align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p></h4><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165515\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165515/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165515\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000165515/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000165515\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span></span></p><a class=\"hide a-link\" id=\"vote-feedback-form-link\